rota lap 4671, row 1 -- Air, the row that feels; single-stranded named the fault exactly: the elder sentence braided a count of the table with a fact about the roster, so the part that stands free kept agreeing while the braided part drifted
think Opened on the card: my own handoff owed %714's remainder, the line-length row. Read it -- already honest, "measured rather than gated", seated 20260911. The row was repaired; the paragraph beneath the table was not.
think That paragraph is a hand census: twenty rows, eight leaning on five rostered tools, six naming a tool no lap runs. Read `20260911.112513`, and carried inside prose, which is the shape count-never-number rules on.
think Derived both figures at each revision of the guide. 11 named / 5 rostered at 050903, 13/6 at 140923, 14/7 today. Stale inside nine hours, and by growth rather than by fault -- two rows seated later that day each arrived with a rostered guard.
think The part worth the lap: rows read TWENTY at every one of those commits and reads twenty now. The cheapest figure to spot-check kept agreeing while the breakdown beneath it moved.
think Built the meter rather than retyping the sentence. Three states -- rostered, driven, unreached -- because the paragraph's SIX is honest only if a tool sharing a row with a rostered driver counts as reached, where a naive count of unrostered tools reads seven.
think The derived unreached names exactly the six the paragraph named by hand. Agreeing on the population is what makes the disagreement on the counts worth trusting.
obs tools_missing is a WALL at zero -- a row citing an absent tool tells a reader to run what cannot run. rows_unheld is a RATCHET, since a row no lap runs is often correct and reasoned, and a wall there would red on rows nobody may repair.
obs Both fault populations print their names every run rather than behind a --list verb -- my own lane's finding of 20260911, one room over, applied to the instrument built the next lap.
obs Two mutations bitten. A walk ending at the first blank line -- the blank between heading and table header -- reads every table as empty and calls the tree clean: 37 legs. A driven test blind to which row a tool sits in: 2 legs.
